<https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/ddc> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "Dewey Decimal Classification"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Local proxies for Dewey Decimal Classification classes, used as mapping targets by the Discipline vocabulary. OCLC withdrew dewey.info and no dereferenceable DDC IRI exists, so TRIPLE mints its own. Notations are those of the source vocabulary: some are truncated (78 for 780) and need review against the classification itself."@en .

